---
source: crates/holst-cli/src/table.rs
expression: help_of(line)
---
Remove old logins, partial files and stale copies that holst keeps on this machine.
The board cache and the saved login stay unless --cache or --all says otherwise.
--all removes the saved login, so it needs -y; without it only the dry run is shown. Plain clean and --cache need no -y.

USAGE
  holst storage clean [flags]

FLAGS
      --cache     Also remove the board cache
      --all       Also remove the board cache and the saved login here, as `holst auth logout --local-only`
  -y, --yes       Confirm a risky change; without it only the dry run is shown (exit code 77)
  -n, --dry-run   Show what would change; change nothing

INHERITED FLAGS
  --output, --verbose, --base-url, --home, --no-cache, --help   as in `holst -h`

EXAMPLES
  $ holst storage clean -n
  $ holst storage clean --cache
  $ holst storage clean --all -y

LEARN MORE
  Exit codes: `holst help exit-codes`.
